WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.067 line:92%
-I want to ask one last question

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:03.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is something that
the president would maybe argu

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:04.771 line:92%
he has in common with you,

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is a background
in construction.

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.576 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, he's very proud
of being a builder.

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:10.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
But he's, you know,
one of those guys

00:00:10.777 --> 00:00:12.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
who I think wears his suit
and puts on a hard hat,

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:14.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
stops by, says "How you doing?
goes home.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:16.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
You actually worked
construction.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:16.883 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I did.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:19.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What part of your life
was your construction job?

00:00:19.119 --> 00:00:20.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That was
while I was in college.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.455 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-And I needed some extra money

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I actually,
I didn't hold signs,

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:26.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is kind of
the traditional role. No.

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:28.795 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I had an 8-pound maul.

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:31.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-And I pounded stakes

00:00:31.264 --> 00:00:35.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
for surveillance --
surveying for a highway.

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:37.604 line:92%
And I did this an entire summer.

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:39.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I felt
that I had to catch up

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
with some of
my college classmates.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:45.111 size:84% position:42%
And so every lunchtime,
I would read a book,

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:47.881 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Building Your Vocabulary
in 30 Days."

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I kind of did
both things at once.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.084 size:78% position:39% line:92%
That is a true story.

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:52.552 line:92%
But I have had a lot of jobs

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.587 line:92%
I was -- Bakers Square pie shop,

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:57.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was a waitress there
for many years.

00:00:57.524 --> 00:01:00.960 align:start size:94% position:6%
My first job
was as a car hop at A&amp;W

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
where, back then, they made us
wear a very tight t-shirt

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
that said,
"Take home a jug of fun."

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God.
-Yeah. That has been --

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:10.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
They've stopped doing that
-That's good.

00:01:10.437 --> 00:01:12.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't want
to get them in trouble.

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:14.574 line:92%
And then you would service calls

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:17.410 align:start size:94% position:6%
from people that would call in
for orders,

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.578 line:92%
and they would make jokes abou

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:21.281 align:start size:94% position:6%
the Mama Burger
and the Papa Burger

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:22.749 align:start size:94% position:6%
and does it make it
the Baby Burger?

00:01:22.749 --> 00:01:24.150 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, gotcha.
-This was my life.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:26.686
-So, and I -- That is very
different than Donald Trump.

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:27.954 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, I think
that's very different.

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:31.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was the guy
making that phone call, 100%

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:31.724 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:33.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
That was definitely
what he was doing.

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:35.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I had a background
in prank calls.

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:37.964
I was very good at that.
Oh, did it a whole summer.

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:41.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He got $413 million
from his dad

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:43.169 line:92%
over the course of his career.

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.838 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-That is his family trust.

00:01:44.838 --> 00:01:49.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
Mine was a coffee can that
my grandpa had in the basement

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:50.910 line:92%
He was an iron ore minor.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he saved money
in that coffee can

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:55.415
to send my dad
to a two-year community college.

00:01:55.415 --> 00:01:58.218 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just can't wait
to get on the debate stage

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.386 line:92%
with Donald Trump and say that

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Applause ]

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:04.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
That might be interesting
to watch.

00:02:04.023 --> 00:02:05.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, thank you so much
for being here.

00:02:05.725 --> 00:02:08.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
Senator Amy Klobuchar,
everybody.

